    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the real property tax law, in relation to providing all local\ngovernments with the option to provide a property tax exemption to volunteer\nfirefighters and volunteer ambulance workers; and to repeal various provisions\nof the real property tax law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S9131",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9131-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
